# PhpStorm HTTP Client — environment: dev
# JWT keys:  make gen-jwt
# JWT token: make gen-jwt-token  → http-client.private.env.json

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Create order (POST /api/v1/investments/orders)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/investments/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "direction": "BUY",
  "quantity": 10,
  "type": "MARKET"
}

###

### Create order — idempotent retry (same Idempotency-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/investments/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKeyRetry}}

{
  "ticker": "AAPL",
  "direction": "BUY",
  "quantity": 10,
  "type": "MARKET"
}
